          "title": "测深、垂深与横向位移",
          "html": "<style>/* Applied only to the56 expansion lessons; data-category colors are preserved. */\n.xl-lesson,.xl-parent{--xl-red:#b8242a;--xl-paper:#f7f4ef;--xl-ink:#292d34;--xl-muted:#66717d;--xl-line:#e6dfd7;color:var(--xl-ink);font-size:18px;line-height:1.85}\nbody.xl-lesson{margin:0;background:var(--xl-paper);font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",system-ui,sans-serif}\n.xl-lesson>header{max-width:1180px;margin:28px auto 0;padding:32px 38px 20px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--xl-line);border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px #3b282608}\n.xl-lesson>header h1{color:#292d34;font-size:clamp(25px,2.6vw,36px);line-height:1.5;max-width:1000px;margin:12px 0}\n.xl-lesson>main{max-width:1180px;margin:24px auto 70px;padding:0 0 25px;min-width:0}\n.xl-lesson>header nav{position:static;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:transparent;border:0;padding:14px 0 0;margin:14px 0 0}\n.xl-lesson>nav{max-width:1180px;margin:18px auto;padding:0 10px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:transparent;border:0;position:static}\n.xl-lesson>nav button[aria-selected=\"true\"]{background:var(--xl-red);border-color:var(--xl-red);color:white}\n.xl-lesson>header nav button,.xl-lesson button,.xl-parent button{font:inherit;line-height:1.5;min-height:44px;cursor:pointer}\n.xl-lesson button,.xl-parent .xl-step-nav button,.xl-parent .xl-next button{background:#fff;color:#4d4343;border:1px solid #ddd5d0;border-radius:13px;padding:10px 17px;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s}\n.xl-lesson button:hover,.xl-parent .xl-step-nav button:hover{border-color:var(--xl-red);background:#fff8f5}\n.xl-lesson button.primary,.xl-lesson button.active,.xl-lesson header nav button[aria-pressed=\"true\"],.xl-lesson header nav button[aria-selected=\"true\"],.xl-step-nav button[aria-selected=\"true\"],.xl-parent .xl-next button{background:var(--xl-red);color:white;border-color:var(--xl-red)}\n.xl-lesson button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}\n.x