ent [hidden]{display:none!important}\n@media(max-width:760px){\n .xl-lesson>header{margin:10px 10px 0;padding:22px 20px 16px;border-radius:19px}.xl-lesson>main{margin:14px 10px 60px;padding:0}\n .xl-lesson>header nav{gap:6px}.xl-lesson>header nav button{font-size:16px;padding:10px}\n .xl-chapter,.xl-opening,.xl-method-step,.xl-lab-guide,.xl-lesson .card,.xl-lesson .panel,.xl-lesson .plot-grid>article,.xl-lesson .reading-block{padding:20px 18px;border-radius:17px}\n .xl-opening h2{font-size:23px}.xl-reading-path{grid-template-columns:1fr}.xl-products{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n .xl-lesson .charts,.xl-lesson .maps,.xl-lesson .split,.xl-lesson .workspace,.xl-lesson .two-columns,.xl-lesson .plot-grid,.xl-lesson .analysis{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)!important;gap:18px}\n .xl-lesson .controls,.xl-lesson .controlgrid,.xl-lesson .control-grid,.xl-lesson .condition-grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)!important}\n .xl-lesson .metric,.xl-lesson .metrics,.xl-lesson .strip{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));flex-wrap:wrap}\n .xl-step-heading{display:block}.xl-step-heading h3{margin-top:8px}.xl-step-nav{gap:6px}.xl-step-nav button{font-size:15px;padding:9px 11px}\n .xl-lesson .charts figure{padding:7px}.xl-lesson .chart,.xl-lesson .plot,.xl-lesson .chart-shell,.xl-lesson .svg-frame{max-width:100%;overflow:auto}\n .xl-knowledge svg,.xl-method-step svg{max-height:240px}.xl-method .case-flow-overview{padding:10px;overflow:auto}.xl-method .case-flow-overview svg{min-width:650px}\n .xl-diagram svg{min-width:680px;max-height:none}.xl-data-plot>svg,.xl-data-plot>canvas{min-width:760px;max-width:none!important;width:760px!important;height:auto}\n .xl-diagram-hint{display:block;position:sticky;left:0;font-size:14px;color:#867476;line-height:1.8;padding:6px 0 2px}\n .xl-lesson .action-row,.xl-lesson .actions,.xl-lesson .bottom-actions{flex-wrap:wrap}.xl-lesson .view-tools{flex-wrap:wrap}\n}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.xl-lesson *,.xl-parent *{scroll-behavior:auto!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style><div class=\"xl-knowledge\"><p class=\"xl-read\"><b>看图时留意</b>在剖面上区分沿井眼的测深、垂直深度与横向位移。</p><p>沿井眼量出的长度是测深MD；相对地面的竖直距离是真垂深TVD。斜井的测深通常大于垂深。这里每一步前进10m，再按井斜角分解成横向位移与垂深增量。</p><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"MD与TVD的分解\"><rect width=\"800\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fafcf9\"/><path d=\"M130 55V225H440L130 55\" stroke=\"#14796f\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"#e7efea\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"145\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">TVD</text><text x=\"287\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">横向位移</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#243740\">MD：沿斜边</text><text x=\"470\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#243740\">每步 ΔMD=10 m</text><text x=\"470\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#243740\">Δx=10 sinθ</text><text x=\"470\" y=\"149\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#243740\">ΔTVD=10 cosθ</text><text x=\"470\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#243740\">θ=30°：5 m、8.66 m</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#243740\">井口</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"278\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#243740\">井深向下增加 ↓</text></svg><figcaption>图B1｜沿井眼长度与竖直深度分开。直角三角形把一段斜井分成横向与竖向位移。MD沿井眼路径量取，TVD沿竖直方向量取。</figcaption></figure></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "PRINCIPLE",
          "title": "弯得太急也有代价",
          "html": "<div class=\"xl-knowledge\"><p class=\"xl-read\"><b>看图时留意</b>查看相邻轨迹段的转向，理解狗腿变化为何受限。</p><p>狗腿度描述单位井段内井眼方向改变的幅度，常用°/30m表示。即使目标更近，过大的局部弯曲也会给工具通过和钻柱运动带来困难。本例把它简化为二维转角约束。</p><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 320\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"指令与响应转角\"><rect width=\"800\" height=\"320\" fill=\"#fafcf9\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#243740\">实际转角 / °</text><path d=\"M85.0 55V240M85 240.0H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"85.0\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">-3</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"245.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">-3</text><path d=\"M243.75 55V240M85 193.75H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"243.75\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">-1.5</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"198.75\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">-1.5</text><path d=\"M402.5 55V240M85 147.5H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"402.5\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">0</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"152.5\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">0</text><path d=\"M561.25 55V240M85 101.25H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"561.25\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">1.5</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"106.25\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">1.5</text><path d=\"M720.0 55V240M85 55.0H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"720.0\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">3</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"60.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">3</text><path d=\"M85.00,215.95L190.83,193.13L296.67,170.32L402.50,147.50L508.33,124.68L614.17,101.87L720.00,79.05\" stroke=\"#14796f\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#14796f\">学习增益0.74</text><path d=\"M85.00,240.00L190.83,209.17L296.67,178.33L402.50,147.50L508.33,116.67L614.17,85.83L720.00,55.00\" stroke=\"#c07648\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"305\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#c07648\">单位增益基线</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"283\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">指令转角 / °</text></svg><figcaption>图B2｜转向响应来自标定。示例指令2°只产生约1.48°实际转角。60步每步10m，总MD固定600m；目标改变后，比较固定路径长度下的末端位置与目标偏差。</figcaption></figure></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "INTERPRETATION",
          "title": "智能方法学习的是动作响应",
          "html": "<div class=\"xl-knowledge\"><p class=\"xl-read\"><b>看图时留意</b>把每次控制动作与下一段轨迹变化对应起来。</p><p>从独立转向试验拟合“指令转角→实际转角”的增益。用学到的增益比较21个横向补偿候选，再把选中动作应用到用户设定的未来响应。未来增益偏离训练增益时，路径会产生误差。</p><p>学习响应、候选搜索、未来推进是三个独立环节。</p><p class=\"sub\">专业资料：<a href=\"https://glossary.slb.com/terms/d/dogleg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SLB｜Dogleg</a>。本例采用固定种子教学数据；数据结构、单位与评价范围在演示中列出。</p><aside class=\"learning-task\"><h3>先做一个可核对实验</h3><p>保持未来增益0.75，将转角上限由7降到2 °/30m并重算，比较轨迹与末端偏差；再将未来增益改为1.3。训练增益保持不变，执行路径和超限数可能改变。60步MD固定600m，因此部分目标位置不可达。</p></aside></div>"
        }
      ],
      "lessonOpening": "<div class=\"xl-opening\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">认识问题 · 再看方法</span><h2>轨迹控制要在到达目标与转弯幅度之间权衡；动作响应和轨迹结果应同时展示。</h2><p>从一次井眼轨迹控制出发，把专业含义、图中位置和计算结果连起来。</p><div class=\"xl-reading-path\"><a href=\"#xl-chapter-0\" data-xl-chapter=\"0\"><span>01</span>测深、垂深与横向位移</a><a href=\"#xl-chapter-1\" data-xl-chapter=\"1\"><span>02</span>弯得太急也有代价</a><a href=\"#xl-chapter-2\" data-xl-chapter=\"2\"><span>03</span>智能方法学习的是动作响应</a></div></div>"
    },
    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "相同转向动作在不同地层中响应不同，怎样兼顾目标偏差与弯曲约束？",
      "lead": [
        "相同转向动作在不同地层中响应不同，怎样兼顾目标偏差与弯曲约束？",
        "按下列手算例理解运算，再进入示范改变同一数据上的模型和基线。"
      ],
      "stats": [
        [
          "步骤",
          "3"
        ],
        [
          "运行",
          "离线"
        ]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "标定转向响应",
          "role": "步骤1",
          "do": "80条转向试验拟合响应增益。",
          "effect": "学习增益与训练样本数",
          "trap": "从独立转向试验拟合增益，再应用于未来推进。"
        },
        {
          "name": "约束内比较候选",
          "role": "步骤2",
          "do": "对21个横向目标补偿进行60步前推。",
          "effect": "候选偏差曲线",
          "trap": "每推进10 m，按转角上限筛选动作。"
        },
        {
          "name": "推进并对照基线",
          "role": "步骤3",
          "do": "使用未来响应推进选中动作，与单位增益追踪比较。",
          "effect": "实际轨迹、目标偏差、超限数",
          "trap": "末端偏差按用户设定的原始目标计算。"
        }
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "title": "逐步核对输入、中间量与评价分母",
        "html": "<style>/* Applied only to the56 expansion lessons; data-category colors are preserved. */\n.xl-lesson,.xl-parent{--xl-red:#b8242a;--xl-paper:#f7f4ef;--xl-ink:#292d34;--xl-muted:#66717d;--xl-line:#e6dfd7;color:var(--xl-ink);font-size:18px;line-height:1.85}\nbody.xl-lesson{margin:0;background:var(--xl-paper);font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",system-ui,sans-serif}\n.xl-lesson>header{max-width:1180px;margin:28px auto 0;padding:32px 38px 20px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--xl-line);border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px #3b282608}\n.xl-lesson>header h1{color:#292d34;font-size:clamp(25px,2.6vw,36px);line-height:1.5;max-width:1000px;margin:12px 0}\n.xl-lesson>main{max-width:1180px;margin:24px auto 70px;padding:0 0 25px;min-width:0}\n.xl-lesson>header nav{position:static;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:transparent;border:0;padding:14px 0 0;margin:14px 0 0}\n.xl-lesson>nav{max-width:1180px;margin:18px auto;padding:0 10px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:transparent;border:0;position:static}\n.xl-lesson>nav button[aria-selected=\"true\"]{background:var(--xl-red);border-color:var(--xl-red);color:white}\n.xl-lesson>header nav button,.xl-lesson button,.xl-parent button{font:inherit;line-height:1.5;min-height:44px;cursor:pointer}\n.xl-lesson button,.xl-parent .xl-step-nav button,.xl-parent .xl-next button{background:#fff;color:#4d4343;border:1px solid #ddd5d0;border-radius:13px;padding:10px 17px;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s}\n.xl-lesson button:hover,.xl-parent .xl-step-nav button:hover{border-color:var(--xl-red);background:#fff8f5}\n.xl-lesson button.primary,.xl-lesson button.active,.xl-lesson header nav button[aria-pressed=\"true\"],.xl-lesson header nav button[aria-selected=\"true\"],.xl-step-nav button[aria-selected=\"true\"],.xl-parent .xl-next button{background:var(--xl-red);color:white;border-color:var(--xl-red)}\n.xl-lesson button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}\n.xl-lesson :focus-visible,.xl-parent :focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b8242a88;outline-offset:4px}\n.xl-lesson input,.xl-lesson select,.xl-lesson textarea{font:inherit;min-width:0;max-width:100%;accent-color:var(--xl-red);border-radius:9px}\n.xl-lesson input[type=range]{width:100%}.xl-lesson label{font-size:17px;color:#45434a}\n.xl-lesson p{max-width:100%;overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n.xl-lesson .intro,.xl-lesson .note,.xl-lesson .small,.xl-lesson .data-note,.xl-lesson .legend,.xl-lesson figcaption,.xl-parent figcaption,.xl-parent .note{font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#64707a}\n.xl-lesson .source-badge,.xl-kicker{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--xl-red);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}\n.xl-lesson .brand,.xl-lesson .eyebrow,.xl-lesson .tag,.xl-lesson .kicker,.xl-lesson output,.xl-lesson>header a{color:var(--xl-red)}\n.xl-parent #tabs .tab.on{background:var(--xl-red);border-color:var(--xl-red);color:#fff}\n.xl-lesson h2,.xl-parent .xl-opening h2{font-size:25px;line-height:1.55;color:#292d34;margin:12px 0 20px}\n.xl-lesson h3{font-size:21px;color:#333842;line-height:1.55}\n.xl-lesson .card,.xl-lesson .panel,.xl-lesson .reading-block,.xl-lesson .plot-grid>article,.xl-chapter,.xl-opening,.xl-method-step,.xl-lab-guide{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--xl-line);border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 5px 22px #382b2105;padding:26px 30px;margin:20px 0}\n.xl-opening{padding:28px 32px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#fff 60%,#fff3ed)}\n.xl-opening h2{max-width:960px;font-size:27px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.65}\n.xl-opening>p{margin-bottom:0;color:var(--xl-muted)}\n.xl-reading-path{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin:24px 0 2px}\n.xl-reading-path a{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;padding:14px 16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #ece3dd;border-radius:14px;color:#4d4343;text-decoration:none;line-height:1.6;font-size:16px}\n.xl-reading-path a span{font-size:13px;color:var(--xl-red);font-weight:750}\n.xl-read{padding:13px 17px;border-left:3px solid var(--xl-red);background:#fbf6f1;color:#5d4f49;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0}\n.xl-read b{display:block;color:var(--xl-red);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:4px}\n.xl-chapter{scroll-margin-top:22px}\n.xl-knowledge>p{margin:20px 0}.xl-knowledge>p.xl-read{margin:0 0 22px}\n.xl-knowledge figure{margin:24px 0}.xl-knowledge svg,.xl-method-step svg{display:block;width:100%;max-width:900px;max-height:280px;height:auto;margin:18px auto}\n.xl-knowledge img{max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:12px}\n.xl-diagram,.xl-data-plot{max-width:100%;min-width:0;overflow:auto}.xl-diagram-hint{display:none}\n.xl-method>.case-flow-overview,.xl-parent .case-flow-overview{margin:20px 0;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--xl-line);border-radius:20px;padding:20px;box-shadow:none}\n.xl-method .case-flow-overview svg{max-height:300px;width:100%;height:auto}\n.xl-step-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:22px 0 14px}\n.xl-step-nav button{font-size:16px;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 13px}\n.xl-step-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin-bottom:18px}.xl-step-heading h3{margin:0;font-size:24px}\n.xl-action-copy>b,.xl-products b{font-size:14px;color:var(--xl-red)}.xl-action-copy p{margin:7px 0 24px}\n.xl-products{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--xl-line);padding-top:18px;margin-top:22px}\n.xl-products p{font-size:17px;margin:7px 0}.xl-next{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin:22px 0}\n.xl-lab-guide{border-top:3px solid var(--xl-red);padding:22px 28px}\n.xl-lab-guide h2{margin:4px 0 10px;font-size:23px}.xl-lab-guide>p{margin:8px 0 16px;color:#645f61;font-size:17px}\n.xl-task-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.xl-task-actions button{font-size:16px}\n.xl-task-actions button[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:#fbebeb;border-color:#c27b7e;color:#9c2026}\n.xl-task-look{padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--xl-line);margin-top:18px!important;font-size:17px;color:#3d4650!important;min-height:1.8em}\n.xl-update{font-size:14px;color:#7d6c67;display:block;margin-top:10px}\n.xl-lesson #status{font-size:16px;border-radius:12px;background:#fff7f2;border:1px solid #edd8ce;color:#754b45;padding:12px 16px}\n.xl-lesson .controls,.xl-lesson .controlgrid,.xl-lesson .control-grid{gap:18px}\n.xl-lesson .toolbar{border-radius:18px;background:#fff9f5;border:1px solid var(--xl-line);padding:18px}\n.xl-lesson .charts{gap:24px}.xl-lesson .charts figure{min-width:0;border:1px solid #eee8e2;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:16px;margin:0}\n.xl-lesson .charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-width:100%}\n.xl-lesson .metric strong,.xl-lesson .metrics strong{color:#a52a31}.xl-lesson .metric>div{border-radius:13px;background:#faf6f1;border:1px solid #e8ded5;color:#514b4b}\n.xl-lesson table{font-size:16px}.xl-lesson th{background:#f5eee8;color:#54474a}.xl-lesson td,.xl-lesson th{padding:11px 13px;border-color:#e9e2da}\n.xl-lesson a{color:#a32c34}.xl-lesson .scroll,.xl-lesson .table-wrap,.xl-lesson .table-scroll{max-width:100%;overflow:auto}\n.xl-fold{margin:18px 0;background:#fcfaf7;border:1px solid #e7ded7;border-radius:15px;padding:14px 18px}\n.xl-fold>summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;color:#665658;line-height:1.8}.xl-fold[open]>summary{margin-bottom:18px}\n.xl-fold>*:not(summary){box-shadow:none}.xl-save{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;padding:20px 0;margin-top:20px}\n.xl-save button{font-size:15px;color:#7a6264;background:transparent;padding:8px 13px;min-height:38px}\n.xl-lesson .learning-task,.xl-lesson #lab>.reading-block:first-child{display:none}\n.xl-parent .sr-eyebrow,.xl-parent .sr-toc button[aria-current=\"true\"]{color:var(--xl-red)}\n.xl-parent .sr-demo-bar{background:#fff9f5;border-color:#e5d6cd}.xl-parent .sr-demo-bar strong{color:#332f36}\n.xl-parent .sr-lede,.xl-parent .sr-toc{background:#fff9f5;border-color:#e5d6cd}\n.xl-lesson [hidden],.xl-parent [hidden]{display:none!important}\n@media(max-width:760px){\n .xl-lesson>header{margin:10px 10px 0;padding:22px 20px 16px;border-radius:19px}.xl-lesson>main{margin:14px 10px 60px;padding:0}\n .xl-lesson>header nav{gap:6px}.xl-lesson>header nav button{font-size:16px;padding:10px}\n .xl-chapter,.xl-opening,.xl-method-step,.xl-lab-guide,.xl-lesson .card,.xl-lesson .panel,.xl-lesson .plot-grid>article,.xl-lesson .reading-block{padding:20px 18px;border-radius:17px}\n .xl-opening h2{font-size:23px}.xl-reading-path{grid-template-columns:1fr}.xl-products{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n .xl-lesson .charts,.xl-lesson .maps,.xl-lesson .split,.xl-lesson .workspace,.xl-lesson .two-columns,.xl-lesson .plot-grid,.xl-lesson .analysis{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)!important;gap:18px}\n .xl-lesson .controls,.xl-lesson .controlgrid,.xl-lesson .control-grid,.xl-lesson .condition-grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)!important}\n .xl-lesson .metric,.xl-lesson .metrics,.xl-lesson .strip{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));flex-wrap:wrap}\n .xl-step-heading{display:block}.xl-step-heading h3{margin-top:8px}.xl-step-nav{gap:6px}.xl-step-nav button{font-size:15px;padding:9px 11px}\n .xl-lesson .charts figure{padding:7px}.xl-lesson .chart,.xl-lesson .plot,.xl-lesson .chart-shell,.xl-lesson .svg-frame{max-width:100%;overflow:auto}\n .xl-knowledge svg,.xl-method-step svg{max-height:240px}.xl-method .case-flow-overview{padding:10px;overflow:auto}.xl-method .case-flow-overview svg{min-width:650px}\n .xl-diagram svg{min-width:680px;max-height:none}.xl-data-plot>svg,.xl-data-plot>canvas{min-width:760px;max-width:none!important;width:760px!important;height:auto}\n .xl-diagram-hint{display:block;position:sticky;left:0;font-size:14px;color:#867476;line-height:1.8;padding:6px 0 2px}\n .xl-lesson .action-row,.xl-lesson .actions,.xl-lesson .bottom-actions{flex-wrap:wrap}.xl-lesson .view-tools{flex-wrap:wrap}\n}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.xl-lesson *,.xl-parent *{scroll-behavior:auto!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style><div class=\"xl-method\"><div class=\"xl-opening\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">沿着资料走一遍</span><h2>相同转向动作在不同地层中响应不同，怎样兼顾目标偏差与弯曲约束？</h2><p>图中的分支对应方法和基线；下面每一步都说明输入、动作与产物，进入演示后可改变条件查看实际数值。</p></div><figure class=\"case-flow-overview case-flow-compact study-workflow-overview\" data-flow-scene=\"d3\" style=\"margin:18px 0 24px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fafbf9;border:1px solid #e0e6e0;border-radius:8px;min-width:0;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><style>.case-flow-compact h3{font-size:19px!important;line-height:1.6!important;color:#355a50;margin:0 0 5px!important}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-scroll{overflow-x:auto;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;overscroll-behavior-x:contain}.case-flow-compact svg{display:block;width:100%;min-width:940px;height:auto;font-family:system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-title{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;fill:#355a50}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-detail{font-size:14px;fill:#6b8078}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-edge{font-size:13px;fill:#70877d;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#fafbf9;stroke-width:4px}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node polygon{stroke:#b7c8bc;stroke-width:1}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[role=button]{cursor:pointer;outline:none}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[aria-current=true] rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[aria-current=true] polygon,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node:focus rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node:focus polygon{stroke:#347a65;stroke-width:2}.case-flow-compact svg text{pointer-events:none}.case-flow-compact figcaption{font-size:14px!important;line-height:1.7!important;color:#75877b;margin:4px 0 0!important}</style><h3>本例方法概览</h3><div class=\"case-flow-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"流程概览，可横向滚动\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1100 250\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"井眼轨迹控制：学到转向响应后怎样接近目标\"><defs><marker id=\"cf-d3\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L6 3L0 6Z\" fill=\"#78958b\"/></marker></defs>\n <path d=\"M210 65H230\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><path d=\"M420 65H440\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><path d=\"M630 65H670\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><path d=\"M800 65H880\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><text x=\"840\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">可继续</text><path d=\"M735 110V140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><text x=\"775\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">需核查</text><path d=\"M325 95V170H440\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">同一观测</text><path d=\"M860 170H870V120H975V95\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><text x=\"927\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">确认后</text><path d=\"M975 95V140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><path d=\"M535 195V222H975V195\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><text x=\"750\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">同条件对照</text>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"0\" data-flow-node=\"input\" transform=\"translate(20 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eef2ed\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">转向试验与目标</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">80条动作响应记录</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"0\" data-flow-node=\"prepare\" transform=\"translate(230 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">学习响应增益</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">冻结训练标定系数</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"model\" transform=\"translate(440 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">候选前向搜索</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">21个横向目标补偿</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"baseline\" transform=\"translate(440 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f4efe4\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">单位增益追踪</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">相同目标与转角上限</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-node=\"gate\" data-flow-step=\"2\"><polygon points=\"735,20 800,65 735,110 670,65\" fill=\"#fbf0d9\"/><text x=\"735\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">输入与场景是否对应？差异需要人工复核吗？</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"review\" transform=\"translate(670 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f6eade\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">检查转角约束</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">定位超限与末端偏差</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"output\" transform=\"translate(880 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">井眼轨迹输出</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">60步轨迹和目标误差</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"compare\" transform=\"translate(880 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">未来响应推进</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">冻结动作序列再执行</text></g>\n </svg></div><figcaption>详细原理、数据图表与计算见下方各步骤。<span data-flow-instruction></span></figcaption></figure><div class=\"xl-step-nav\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"方法步骤\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"xl-method-0\" data-xl-step=\"0\">01 标定转向响应</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"xl-method-1\" data-xl-step=\"1\">02 约束内比较候选</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"xl-method-2\" data-xl-step=\"2\">03 推进并对照基线</button></div><article class=\"xl-method-step\" id=\"xl-method-0\" data-xl-panel=\"0\"><div class=\"xl-step-heading\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">01 / 3</span><h3>标定转向响应</h3></div><div class=\"xl-action-copy\"><b>输入与动作</b><p>80条转向试验拟合响应增益。</p></div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>先看指令是否等于响应（手算教学例）</caption><thead><tr><th>指令转角 / °</th><th>增益</th><th>响应转角 / °</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>0.74</td><td>0.74</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>0.74</td><td>1.48</td></tr><tr><td>-2</td><td>0.74</td><td>-1.48</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"xl-products\"><div><b>得到什么</b><p>学习增益与训练样本数</p></div><div><b>理解这一步</b><p>从独立转向试验拟合增益，再应用于未来推进。</p></div></div></article><article class=\"xl-method-step\" id=\"xl-method-1\" data-xl-panel=\"1\"><div class=\"xl-step-heading\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">02 / 3</span><h3>约束内比较候选</h3></div><div class=\"xl-action-copy\"><b>输入与动作</b><p>对21个横向目标补偿进行60步前推。</p></div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>每步分解位移（手算教学例）</caption><thead><tr><th>ΔMD / m</th><th>θ / °</th><th>Δx / m</th><th>ΔTVD / m</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>10</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>30</td><td>5</td><td>8.66</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>60</td><td>8.66</td><td>5</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"xl-products\"><div><b>得到什么</b><p>候选偏差曲线</p></div><div><b>理解这一步</b><p>每推进10 m，按转角上限筛选动作。</p></div></div></article><article class=\"xl-method-step\" id=\"xl-method-2\" data-xl-panel=\"2\"><div class=\"xl-step-heading\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">03 / 3</span><h3>推进并对照基线</h3></div><div class=\"xl-action-copy\"><b>输入与动作</b><p>使用未来响应推进选中动作，与单位增益追踪比较。</p></div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>目标与终点比较（手算教学例）</caption><thead><tr><th>目标(x,z) / m</th><th>终点(x,z) / m</th><th>欧氏距离 / m</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>(180,550)</td><td>(190,530)</td><td>√(10²+20²)=22.36</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"xl-products\"><div><b>得到什么</b><p>实际轨迹、目标偏差、超限数</p></div><div><b>理解这一步</b><p>末端偏差按用户设定的原始目标计算。</p></div></div></article><div class=\"xl-next\"><button type=\"button\" data-xl-tab=\"lab\">用当前数据检验这条流程 →</button></div></div>"
      },
      "lessonHTML": "<div class=\"xl-method\"><div class=\"xl-opening\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">沿着资料走一遍</span><h2>相同转向动作在不同地层中响应不同，怎样兼顾目标偏差与弯曲约束？</h2><p>图中的分支对应方法和基线；下面每一步都说明输入、动作与产物，进入演示后可改变条件查看实际数值。</p></div><figure class=\"case-flow-overview case-flow-compact study-workflow-overview\" data-flow-scene=\"d3\" style=\"margin:18px 0 24px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fafbf9;border:1px solid #e0e6e0;border-radius:8px;min-width:0;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><style>.case-flow-compact h3{font-size:19px!important;line-height:1.6!important;color:#355a50;margin:0 0 5px!important}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-scroll{overflow-x:auto;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;overscroll-behavior-x:contain}.case-flow-compact svg{display:block;width:100%;min-width:940px;height:auto;font-family:system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-title{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;fill:#355a50}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-detail{font-size:14px;fill:#6b8078}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-edge{font-size:13px;fill:#70877d;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#fafbf9;stroke-width:4px}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node polygon{stroke:#b7c8bc;stroke-width:1}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[role=button]{cursor:pointer;outline:none}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[aria-current=true] rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[aria-current=true] polygon,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node:focus rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node:focus polygon{stroke:#347a65;stroke-width:2}.case-flow-compact svg text{pointer-events:none}.case-flow-compact figcaption{font-size:14px!important;line-height:1.7!important;color:#75877b;margin:4px 0 0!important}</style><h3>本例方法概览</h3><div class=\"case-flow-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"流程概览，可横向滚动\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1100 250\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"井眼轨迹控制：学到转向响应后怎样接近目标\"><defs><marker id=\"cf-d3\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L6 3L0 6Z\" fill=\"#78958b\"/></marker></defs>\n <path d=\"M210 65H230\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><path d=\"M420 65H440\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><path d=\"M630 65H670\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><path d=\"M800 65H880\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><text x=\"840\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">可继续</text><path d=\"M735 110V140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><text x=\"775\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">需核查</text><path d=\"M325 95V170H440\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">同一观测</text><path d=\"M860 170H870V120H975V95\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><text x=\"927\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">确认后</text><path d=\"M975 95V140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><path d=\"M535 195V222H975V195\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d3)\"/><text x=\"750\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">同条件对照</text>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"0\" data-flow-node=\"input\" transform=\"translate(20 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eef2ed\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">转向试验与目标</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">80条动作响应记录</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"0\" data-flow-node=\"prepare\" transform=\"translate(230 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">学习响应增益</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">冻结训练标定系数</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"model\" transform=\"translate(440 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">候选前向搜索</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">21个横向目标补偿</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"baseline\" transform=\"translate(440 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f4efe4\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">单位增益追踪</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">相同目标与转角上限</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-node=\"gate\" data-flow-step=\"2\"><polygon points=\"735,20 800,65 735,110 670,65\" fill=\"#fbf0d9\"/><text x=\"735\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">输入与场景是否对应？差异需要人工复核吗？</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"review\" transform=\"translate(670 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f6eade\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">检查转角约束</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">定位超限与末端偏差</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"output\" transform=\"translate(880 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">井眼轨迹输出</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">60步轨迹和目标误差</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"compare\" transform=\"translate(880 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">未来响应推进</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">冻结动作序列再执行</text></g>\n </svg></div><figcaption>详细原理、数据图表与计算见下方各步骤。<span data-flow-instruction></span></figcaption></figure><div class=\"xl-step-nav\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"方法步骤\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"xl-method-0\" data-xl-step=\"0\">01 标定转向响应</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"xl-method-1\" data-xl-step=\"1\">02 约束内比较候选</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"xl-method-2\" data-xl-step=\"2\">03 推进并对照基线</button></div><article class=\"xl-method-step\" id=\"xl-method-0\" data-xl-panel=\"0\"><div class=\"xl-step-heading\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">01 / 3</span><h3>标定转向响应</h3></div><div class=\"xl-action-copy\"><b>输入与动作</b><p>80条转向试验拟合响应增益。</p></div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>先看指令是否等于响应（手算教学例）</caption><thead><tr><th>指令转角 / °</th><th>增益</th><th>响应转角 / °</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>0.74</td><td>0.74</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>0.74</td><td>1.48</td></tr><tr><td>-2</td><td>0.74</td><td>-1.48</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"xl-products\"><div><b>得到什么</b><p>学习增益与训练样本数</p></div><div><b>理解这一步</b><p>从独立转向试验拟合增益，再应用于未来推进。</p></div></div></article><article class=\"xl-method-step\" id=\"xl-method-1\" data-xl-panel=\"1\"><div class=\"xl-step-heading\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">02 / 3</span><h3>约束内比较候选</h3></div><div class=\"xl-action-copy\"><b>输入与动作</b><p>对21个横向目标补偿进行60步前推。</p></div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>每步分解位移（手算教学例）</caption><thead><tr><th>ΔMD / m</th><th>θ / °</th><th>Δx / m</th><th>ΔTVD / m</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>10</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>30</td><td>5</td><td>8.66</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>60</td><td>8.66</td><td>5</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"xl-products\"><div><b>得到什么</b><p>候选偏差曲线</p></div><div><b>理解这一步</b><p>每推进10 m，按转角上限筛选动作。</p></div></div></article><article class=\"xl-method-step\" id=\"xl-method-2\" data-xl-panel=\"2\"><div class=\"xl-step-heading\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">03 / 3</span><h3>推进并对照基线</h3></div><div class=\"xl-action-copy\"><b>输入与动作</b><p>使用未来响应推进选中动作，与单位增益追踪比较。</p></div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>目标与终点比较（手算教学例）</caption><thead><tr><th>目标(x,z) / m</th><th>终点(x,z) / m</th><th>欧氏距离 / m</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>(180,550)</td><td>(190,530)</td><td>√(10²+20²)=22.36</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"xl-products\"><div><b>得到什么</b><p>实际轨迹、目标偏差、超限数</p></div><div><b>理解这一步</b><p>末端偏差按用户设定的原始目标计算。</p></div></div></article><div class=\"xl-next\"><button type=\"button\" data-xl-tab=\"lab\">用当前数据检验这条流程 →</button></div></div>"
